Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:09:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] test: hermetic test harness (in-process PGlite, no
 network, no .env)

The four DB suites in src/db/*.test.ts load .env and write to the shared
dev/production Neon database. This adds a runner that cannot:
- scrubs DB/Stripe/Resend/Uploadthing/Neon/Vercel env, sentinel DATABASE_URL
- redirects src/db.ts to an in-process PGlite built from src/db/migrations
- blocks outbound fetch; refuses any suite that reads .env / DATABASE_URL
- runs bun:test-style suites under Node 22+ (bun test still works)

PGlite devDependency matches fix/breeder-subscription-cancellation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
